<title>HONG KONG: HK Electric sets HK$3.5 bln loan.</title>
<headline>HK Electric sets HK$3.5 bln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following syndicated loan</p>
<p>issue was announced by arranger HSBC Investment Bank Asia.</p>
<p>  BORROWER  HONG KONG ELECTRIC		 TYPE TERM LOAN</p>
<p>  AMOUNT    HK$3.5 BLN, SPLIT AS (A)HK$1.75 BLN (B)HK$1.75 BLN</p>
<p>  MATURITY  (A) 7 YRS, WITH PUT IN YEAR 5  (B) 7 YRS</p>
<p>  MARGIN    (A) 35 BP    (B) 40 BP	   REPAY    BULLET</p>
<p>  PUTS	(A) YR 5     (B) NONE	    CALLS    NONE</p>
<p>  LAUNCHED  05.MAR.97    AVAIL    2 YRS    HOME CTRY HONG KONG</p>
<p>  REPLIES   END MARCH    NOTES    FINANCIAL COVENANTS APPLY</p>
<p>  ARRANGERS HSBC INVESTMENT BANK ASIA</p>
<p>  MGT LEVELS		 SNR ARRANGERS HK$400 MLN</p>
<p>				 ARRANGERS     HK$300 MLN</p>
<p>**AN ARRANGER GROUP IS BEING FORMED***</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
